Title: Module INtegration by On-demand Translation of Annotations using R
Description:
    ariadne provides a rapid and robust approach to incorporate taxonomic and
    functional module analyses into your bioinformatic workflow. Despite the
    presence of specialised bioinformatic tools, on-demand functional annotation
    of taxonomic features directly in R has remained challenging. To make this
    simple, ariadne offers tools to rapidly annotate features with taxonomic or
    functional modules based on online resources (BugSigDB, ChocoPhlAn, Web of
    Life and UniProt). In addition, we provide tools to incorporate, analyse and
    visualise module information into popular standardised containers, such as
    TreeSummarizedExperiment.
